WEBVTT

00:00:10.146 --> 00:00:11.691
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What do you do?

00:00:12.489 --> 00:00:13.757
<v></b>Talitha:</b></v> I work in marketing.

00:00:14.807 --> 00:00:16.848
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> How many hours a week do you work?

00:00:17.367 --> 00:00:19.283
<v></b>Talitha:</b></v> I work for thirty-seven hours a week.

00:00:25.345 --> 00:00:27.058
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Do you have a big family?

00:00:27.425 --> 00:00:28.865
<v><b>Joelle:</b></v> No, I have a small family.

00:00:28.984 --> 00:00:30.786
One sister and parents.

00:00:31.006 --> 00:00:32.641
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> How old is your sister?

00:00:32.665 --> 00:00:33.918
<v><b>Joelle:</b></v> My sister is thirteen.

00:00:40.207 --> 00:00:42.218
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What time do you get up in the morning?

00:00:42.684 --> 00:00:44.851
<v><b>Sophie:</b></v> Usually around half past seven.

00:00:45.436 --> 00:00:46.905
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What about on weekends?

00:00:47.927 --> 00:00:51.505
<v><b>Sophie:</b></v> Much later. Probably half past nine, ten o’clock.

00:00:57.553 --> 00:01:00.177
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> How often do you play sports or exercise?

00:01:00.444 --> 00:01:01.396
What do you do?

00:01:01.761 --> 00:01:07.689
<v><b>Jake:</b></v> I do sports about twice a week…going to the gym.

00:01:07.689 --> 00:01:09.647
And I walk one hour to school.

00:01:15.810 --> 00:01:17.556
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What do you like about New York?

00:01:17.730 --> 00:01:18.303
<v><b>Tom:</b></v> New York?

00:01:18.996 --> 00:01:22.167
The variety. The people. Change.

00:01:22.191 --> 00:01:23.339
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What don’t you like?

00:01:23.726 --> 00:01:24.588
<v><b>Tom:</b></v> What don’t I like?

00:01:27.686 --> 00:01:28.546
No, not much.